{'symbol': 'KHC', 'date': '2021-12-10 05:00:00', 'title': 'KRAFT HEINZ ANNOUNCES AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE MAJORITY STAKE IN JUST SPICES – A TECHNOLOGY-ENABLED DIRECT-TO-CONSUMER BUSINESS', 'text': "PITTSBURGH & CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE KRAFT HEINZ COMPANY (NASDAQ: KHC) (“KRAFT HEINZ”) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS REACHED AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE AN 85% STAKE IN GERMANY-BASED JUST SPICES GMBH (“JUST SPICES”). THE REMAINING 15% OWNERSHIP STAKE WILL BE RETAINED BY JUST SPICES' THREE FOUNDERS, WHO WILL CONTINUE ON WITH THE COMPANY AND FOCUS ON DRIVING THE BUSINESS AND ITS INTERNATIONAL GROWTH. LAUNCHED IN 2014, JUST SPICES IS AN INNOVATIVE START-UP, TRAILBLAZING THE HIGH-GROWTH TASTE ELEVA"}